        "text": "Thinking Machines publishes two separate price lists. Tinker serverless inference for Inkling is $1.00 per million input tokens, $0.17 per million cached input tokens, and $4.05 per million output tokens at the 256K context tier. Inkling-Small, the 276B/12B sibling, is $0.30 per million input, $0.06 cached input, and $1.20 per million output at the same context. The numbers are published as machine-readable JSON at tinker-docs.thinkingmachines.ai/tinker/serverless.json, so they can be pulled programmatically rather than scraped."
